  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Force experienced by a particle with charge <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math>&nbsp;in an electric field&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>E</mi></math>.</p><p>Now,&nbsp;the acceleration produced is given as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>F</mi><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp; (As the particle is projected against the electric field, hence it is&nbsp;decelerated)</p><p>Using,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></math></p><p>We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mn>200</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>",
